HUWE SHAHEED IMAM-E-RAZA KARO MATAM<br>
SAR APNA PEET KE AHLE AZA KARO MATAM<br>
<br>
Hai beqaar ghareebul watan imam mera<br>
Hata ke farshe zameen par tadapte hain moula<br>
The jiske ke peeshe nazar waqayat-e-karbobala<br>
Usi ghareeb pa kar ke buka karo matam<br>
<br>
Shaheed zehre dagha se huwe Imam-e-Raza<br>
Tha saare Ahl-e-Khurasaa&rsquo;n mein tahelka barpa<br>
Har ek chahane wala ye de raha hai sada<br>
Hai do jahan mein gham ki faza karo matam<br>
<br>
Jo khake aaye hain angoor-e-zehr dar Raza<br>
Tadap rahe hain bahot hoke beqaar Raza<br>
Lahu ugalte the reh reh ke bar bar Raza<br>
Imam hota hai hum se juda karo matam<br>
<br>
Chali thi bhaye se milne jo gham zada khawhar<br>
Siyah saara khurasaan juhin aaya nazar<br>
Sambhal na payein huwe ghash suni jo gham ki khabar<br>
Ye gham hai misle gham-e-karbala karo matam<br>
<br>
Mere imam hamhein ho sharaf ziyarat ka<br>
De bar bar hamhein mouqa is ibadat ka<br>
Jo shehare tous mein pohunche ho din shahadat ka<br>
Baha ke ashk ye maango dua karo matam<br>
<br>
Pasina mout ka mathe pe aagaya jisdam<br>
Pisar ko deke sada peet te the sar paiham<br>
Pidar ke paas Taqi the be deda-e-purnam<br>
Sohail aaye Raza ko qaza karo matam
